Rule 1 (tensor shapes should be the same)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= ndim(v_1) = ndim(v_2) ∧ ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : shape(v_1, i) = shape(v_2, i)
>>
Rule 3 (tensor should not be empty)
{v_1 : tensor} |= ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : shape(v_1, i) > 0
>>
Rule 4 (input tensor must be 1-dimensional)
{v_1 : tensor} |= ndim(v_1) = 1
>>
Rule 5 (tensor should not be zero)
{v_1 : tensor} |= ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : shape(v_1, i) ≠ 0
>>
Rule 9 (tensor should not have invalid shape)
{v_1 : tensor} |= ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : shape(v_1, i) > 0 ∧ shape(v_1, i) ≠ 0
